.DS_Store
build/
# a second derived data path, for building while a run is going in build/
build-estimate/
# a third, for the Release build that proves the demo is not in the app as it
# ships: strings on its binary says nothing about a demo
build-release/
# the cf cli's account cache, left by the R2 calls in scripts/release.sh, and
# wrangler's, from before the script used cf
.cloudflare/
.wrangler/
# generated by xcodegen from project.yml, which is the source of truth
*.xcodeproj/
# filled by scripts/vendor.sh from Homebrew; only the module map is tracked
Vendor/*
!Vendor/include/
Vendor/include/*
!Vendor/include/module.modulemap
# the licensed Suisse Intl files scripts/dmg-background.html renders with
scripts/fonts/
